{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, as an iOS document provider."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting to Safari","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-to-Safari"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From iOS 26, a page in Safari can ask for an ISO mdoc with the W3C"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, using the "},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol (ISO\/IEC TS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-7 Annex C). iOS offers the apps that registered a matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document, and shows the chosen app’s document provider extension for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder’s consent. The extension answers through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)"},{"type":"text","text":"; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response goes back through Safari, encrypted to the page, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network request from the wallet."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Safari sends only "},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", not OpenID4VP, and on iOS only:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Safari on macOS has no document providers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Set-up-the-app-and-its-extension","type":"heading","text":"Set up the app and its extension","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The extension:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a target whose Info.plist names the extension"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.identity-document-services.document-provider-ui"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXAppExtensionAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXExtensionPointIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The capability:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Digital Credentials API – Mobile Document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, on both the app’s and the extension’s App IDs, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doctypes the app presents in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.identity-document-services.document-provider.mobile-document-types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlement. Apple allows only certain doctypes, such as the ISO mDL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and Photo ID."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shared storage:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" the extension is another process, so the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its credentials in an App Group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), and its holder keys in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a Keychain access group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Instance and DPoP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"‘s registration key, stay in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s default group: the extension presents, but doesn’t receive."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default group is the first in the app’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlement, so list a group only the app has first and the shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group after it; listed first, the shared group becomes the default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and those keys land where the extension can use them. The app saves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its configuration where the extension can read it too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A wallet that starts on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/standard(options:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the default "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and adds the extension later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t hand the extension what it already holds: its credentials are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bound to holder keys in the app’s own group, and the package has no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call that moves credentials or keys to the shared ones. Its holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would receive each credential again. If the app may ever present to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Safari, start on the App Group store and the shared holder key group"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from its first release."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["<key>keychain-access-groups<\/key>","<array>","    <string>$(AppIdentifierPrefix)com.example.wallet<\/string>        <!-- the app's own: the default -->","    <string>$(AppIdentifierPrefix)com.example.wallet.shared<\/string> <!-- shared with the extension -->","<\/array>"],"syntax":null}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import IdentityDocumentServices","import IdentityDocumentServicesUI","import OID4VCWallet","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ What the app and its document provider extension share.","enum SharedWallet {","    static let appGroup = \"group.com.example.wallet\"","    static let holderKeyGroup = \"ABCDE12345.com.example.wallet.shared\"","","    \/\/\/ The configuration the app saved in the group's defaults.","    static func configuration() throws -> WalletConfiguration {","        guard let data = UserDefaults(suiteName: appGroup)?.data(forKey: \"configuration\") else { throw CocoaError(.fileNoSuchFile) }","        return try JSONDecoder().decode(WalletConfiguration.self, from: data)","    }","","    \/\/\/ The wallet over the shared store and holder keys: the app passes","    \/\/\/ its Wallet Provider; the extension, which only presents, nil.","    static func open(provider: (any WalletProvider)?) throws -> Wallet {","        try Wallet(","            configuration: try configuration(),","            keyStore: KeychainKeyStore(options: .init(holderAccessGroup: holderKeyGroup)),","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.inAppGroup(appGroup),","            provider: provider)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Register-the-documents","type":"heading","text":"Register the documents","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS offers the app only for documents it registered. Whenever the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials change — and after status checks, which can make one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unpresentable — register each presentable mdoc and remove the rest."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" names the reader CAs, by subject key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, whose requests the document answers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Registers the held mdocs of `doctypes` with iOS, so Safari offers the","\/\/\/ app for them. The first registration asks the holder to allow it.","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","func registerDocuments(_ credentials: [CredentialSummary], doctypes: Set<String>, readerAuthorities: [Data]) async throws {","    let store = IdentityDocumentProviderRegistrationStore()","    for registration in try await store.registrations {","        try await store.removeRegistration(forDocumentIdentifier: registration.documentIdentifier)","    }","    \/\/ Presentable: unexpired, not found revoked or suspended, and its key still here.","    for credential in credentials where credential.format == \"mso_mdoc\" && doctypes.contains(credential.doctype ?? \"\")","        && credential.presentable && credential.holderKeyPresent != false {","        try await store.addRegistration(MobileDocumentRegistration(","            mobileDocumentType: credential.doctype ?? \"\",","            supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers: readerAuthorities,","            documentIdentifier: credential.id,","            invalidationDate: credential.validUntil))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Answer-in-the-extension","type":"heading","text":"Answer in the extension","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS hands the extension the request in two stages. First,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.request","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" describes what’s asked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the consent screen: show it with the website’s origin, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidates from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder shares does iOS release the request itself, to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"sendResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s closure. Validate it there, parse it, check it’s what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder was shown, and answer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct WalletDocumentProvider: IdentityDocumentProvider {","    var body: some IdentityDocumentRequestScene {","        ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestScene { context in","            ConsentView(context: context)","        }","    }","","    func performRegistrationUpdates() async {}","}","","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct ConsentView: View {","    let context: ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext","    @State private var problem: String?","    \/\/\/ The one wallet this request uses, opened when the screen appears.","    @State private var wallet: Wallet?","    \/\/\/ The candidate shared, from `Wallet.mdocCandidates(origin:)`.","    @State private var chosen: CredentialSummary?","","    \/\/\/ The request's first document as iOS parsed it: what the consent","    \/\/\/ screen shows the holder.","    private var shown: (doctype: String, elements: [MdocPresentation.Element])? {","        guard let document = context.request.presentmentRequests.first?.documentRequestSets.first?.requests.first else {","            return nil","        }","        let elements = document.namespaces.flatMap { namespace, elements in","            elements.map { MdocPresentation.Element(namespace: namespace, identifier: $0.key, retain: $0.value.isRetaining) }","        }","        return (document.documentType, elements)","    }","","    var body: some View {","        VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            \/\/ Who asks, and exactly what `share()` answers: the","            \/\/ response is bound to these elements, so the holder must","            \/\/ see each one, and whether the website says it keeps it.","            Text(\"\\(context.requestingWebsiteOrigin?.absoluteString ?? \"An unknown website\") asks for:\")","            if let shown {","                Text(shown.doctype)","                ForEach(Array(shown.elements.enumerated()), id: \\.offset) { _, element in","                    Text(element.retain ? \"\\(element.identifier) (the website will keep it)\" : element.identifier)","                }","            }","            if let problem { Text(problem) }","            if chosen?.linkableHere == true { Text(\"This website could link this to another.\") }","            Button(\"Share\") { Task { await share() } }.disabled(chosen == nil)","            Button(\"Cancel\") { context.cancel() }","        }","        .task {","            guard let shown, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","                  let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","            do {","                let opened = try SharedWallet.open(provider: nil)","                wallet = opened","                \/\/ Every held mdoc is a candidate, an expired or revoked","                \/\/ one too: offer only one that can be presented.","                chosen = try await opened.mdocCandidates(origin: origin)","                    .first { $0.doctype == shown.doctype && $0.presentable }","            } catch {","                problem = \"Can't read the wallet: \\(error)\"","            }","        }","    }","","    \/\/\/ Shares the chosen mdoc, for exactly the document and elements the","    \/\/\/ holder was shown.","    func share() async {","        guard let shown, let chosen, let wallet, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","              let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","        let agreed = MdocPresentation.Shown(doctype: shown.doctype, elements: shown.elements,","                                            credentialID: chosen.id, toldLinkable: chosen.linkableHere == true)","        do {","            try await context.sendResponse { raw in","                _ = try IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequestValidator()","                    .validateISO18013MobileDocumentRequest(raw.requestData, origin: originURL)","                let presentation = try await wallet.startMdocPresentation(requestData: raw.requestData, origin: origin)","                \/\/ Answer only what the holder was shown, or throw","                \/\/ RequestChanged. The holder key signs now: Face ID, if","                \/\/ the key store asks.","                let response = try await presentation.respond(shown: [agreed], readerCertificate: nil)","                return ISO18013MobileDocumentResponse(responseData: response.response)","            }","        } catch {","            \/\/ Nothing was shared: say so, and let the holder cancel.","            problem = \"Not shared: \\(error)\"","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)"},{"type":"text","text":" answers the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements the holder was shown, not those the released request names,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and refuses, with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/RequestChanged"},{"type":"text","text":", a request that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed in between: a shown document no longer asked for, or asked for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with other elements; a chosen credential that no longer answers it; or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one that became linkable here when the holder wasn’t told"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Shown\/toldLinkable"},{"type":"text","text":"). Where the consent screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names the reader (below), pass that reader’s certificate as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"readerCertificate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and a request signed by any other is refused too."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/answers(for:readerCertificate:)"},{"type":"text","text":" makes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same check without answering. The demo wallet’s "},{"code":"DocumentProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"target does all of this, with several documents, a choice of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential and a linkability warning."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Name-the-reader","type":"heading","text":"Name the reader","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A page’s request may be signed by its reader’s certificate (ISO\/IEC"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-5 reader authentication). When the certificate chains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/VerifierTrust\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names it; otherwise show only the website’s origin."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/VerifierTrust\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issued for readers, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/VerifierTrust\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses requests from any other reader before the holder sees them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Warn-of-linkable-presentations","type":"heading","text":"Warn of linkable presentations","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each candidate’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting it would hand this website a copy another website has seen,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable"},{"type":"text","text":" whether it did. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension doesn’t refresh used-up copies: have the app do it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next becomes active, after listing its credentials again."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Presenting to Safari","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"kind":"article","references":{"https://github.com/IDFoundry/OID4VCgo/blob/main/mobile/WALLET_PROVIDER.md":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo\/blob\/main\/mobile\/WALLET_PROVIDER.md","title":"WALLET_PROVIDER.md","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WALLET_PROVIDER.md"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo\/blob\/main\/mobile\/WALLET_PROVIDER.md"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"title":"OID4VCWallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","role":"collection"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)":{"type":"topic","title":"startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Parses an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" request — an mdoc asked for over the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, as iOS hands one to a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension — and finds the held mdocs that can answer it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestData"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequest.requestData"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" the requesting page’s origin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.requestingWebsiteOrigin"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as ","type":"text"},{"code":"MdocPresentation.origin(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" serializes it.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/startmdocpresentation(requestdata:origin:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startMdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestData","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"origin","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A store in the app group "},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s container"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its extensions listing the group in their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"com.apple.security.application-groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement share."}],"title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"inAppGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"options","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Options"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","title":"KeychainKeyStore","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"title":"WalletProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletProvider"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletProvider"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/respond(shown:rea